    "answer": {
      "short": "Normal pay: $\\$914.10$; overtime pay: $\\$249.30$; total weekly wage: $\\$1163.40$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Normal pay} &= 27.70\\times33\\\\\\text{Normal pay} &= \\$914.10\\\\\\text{Overtime pay} &= 27.70\\times6\\times1.5\\\\\\text{Overtime pay} &= \\$249.30\\\\\\text{Total pay} &= 914.10+249.30\\\\\\text{Total pay} &= \\$1163.40\\end{align*}$$",
